     55  1d70							; pulse: release from the current level; step = level x factor / 4 + 1
     56  1d70							; (8.8 per 10 ms), so any level fades out in 10.24 s / factor (PADS: 5,
     57  1d70							; about 2 s). Factor 0: no release, cut.
     58  1d70		       ad 6a c4 	      lda	envRelV
